{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laravel/framework/issues/37370","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laravel/framework","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laravel/framework/issues/37370/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laravel/framework/issues/37370/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laravel/framework/issues/37370/events","html_url":"https://github.com/laravel/framework/issues/37370","id":892104868,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU4OTIxMDQ4Njg=","number":37370,"title":"Signed URLs containing empty querystring values will not validate","user":{"login":"jelib3an","id":50533338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNTMzMzM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50533338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jelib3an","html_url":"https://github.com/jelib3an","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jelib3an/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jelib3an/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jelib3an/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jelib3an/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jelib3an/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jelib3an/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jelib3an/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jelib3an/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jelib3an/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":24480042,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNDQ4MDA0Mg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laravel/framework/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ee0701","default":true,"description":""},{"id":1993557750,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTkzNTU3NzUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laravel/framework/labels/help%20wanted","name":"help wanted","color":"008672","default":true,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":12,"created_at":"2021-05-14T17:22:11Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T19:37:12Z","closed_at":"2021-05-20T18:45:24Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"- Laravel Version: 8.41.0\r\n- PHP Version: 7.4.16\r\n- Database Driver & Version: n/a\r\n\r\n### Description:\r\n\r\nIf a url contains querystring parameters with empty values, the generated signed url will not validate. \r\n\r\n### Steps To Reproduce:\r\n\r\n```php\r\n<?php\r\n\r\n// routes/web.php\r\n\r\nuse Illuminate\\Http\\Request;\r\nuse Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Route;\r\nuse Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\URL;\r\n\r\nRoute::get('/', function () {\r\n    $url = URL::signedRoute('signature-required', [\r\n        'param1',\r\n        'param2' => '',\r\n    ]);\r\n\r\n    echo '<a href=\"'.e($url).'\">'.e($url).'</a>';\r\n});\r\n\r\nRoute::get('/signature-required', function (Request $request) {\r\n    if ($request->hasValidSignature()) {\r\n        echo 'Valid';\r\n    } else {\r\n        echo 'Not Valid';\r\n    }\r\n})->name('signature-required');\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis will generate a url that looks like this:\r\nhttp://localhost:8000/signature-required?param2=&signature=6f4e4fe0dfa152bd0c2276a4180a3ec5259e42ae7ae6e14a2d19e1a2a9bb7b9c&param1\r\n\r\nNot sure what possible use cases there are for empty string values, perhaps one just wants to check for the presence of a parameter? Of course, the workaround is to not use empty values. But since the signed url has been created, one would at least not expect that it wouldn't validate.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"taylorotwell","id":463230,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MzIzMA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/463230?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/taylorotwell","html_url":"https://github.com/taylorotwell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taylorotwell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taylorotwell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taylorotwell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taylorotwell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taylorotwell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taylorotwell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taylorotwell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taylorotwell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taylorotwell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laravel/framework/issues/37370/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laravel/framework/issues/37370/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}